<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SaturvOS // Blog</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --amarelo: #FFEA00;
            --preto: #0c0c0c;
            --branco: #e0e0e0;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background-color: var(--preto);
            color: var(--branco);
            font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .main-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        header {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #333;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--amarelo);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        }

        .back-link {
            color: #aaa;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            color: var(--amarelo);
        }

        .entry {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--amarelo);
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        .entry-date {
            color: var(--amarelo);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .entry-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: var(--branco);
        }

        .entry-content {
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="main-container">
    <header>
        <a href="index.html" class="back-link">&lt; Voltar para a Home</a>
        <h1>Daily Log</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- Para adicionar um novo post, basta copiar este bloco .entry -->
        <article class="entry">
            <div class="entry-date">[2026-11-03]</div>
            <h2 class="entry-title">Primeira entrada do log</h2>
            <div class="entry-content">
                Primeiro blog pessoal do pwrat e do saturvos nada aqui possa ser interessante 
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>
</div>

</body>
</html>
